in="18.777" end="19.323">girl</span> <span begin="19.323" end="19.575">you</span> <span begin="19.575" end="19.809">make</span> <span begin="19.809" end="20.688">everything</span> <span begin="20.688" end="21.066">feel</span> <span begin="21.066" end="21.921">alright</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漂亮女孩 你让一切都美好起来</span></p><p begin="22.243" end="25.801" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.243" end="22.553">Pretty</span> <span begin="22.553" end="23.218">girl</span> <span begin="23.218" end="23.495">pretty</span> <span begin="23.495" end="24.002">as</span> <span begin="24.002" end="24.133">the</span> <span begin="24.133" end="24.548">stars</span> <span begin="24.548" end="24.819">in</span> <span begin="24.819" end="25.080">the</span> <span begin="25.080" end="25.801">sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">漂亮女孩 如夜空中的繁星般明媚</span></p><p begin="26.061" end="31.283" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.061" end="26.366">Belt</span> <span begin="26.366" end="26.775">of</span> <span begin="26.775" end="27.857">Orion</span> <span begin="27.857" end="28.053">the</span> <span begin="28.053" end="28.385">way</span> <span begin="28.385" end="28.690">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="28.690" end="30.192">alig</span><span begin="30.192" end="31.283">ning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">像猎户座的星光轨迹 我们如此契合</span></p><p begin="31.532" end="34.244" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.532" end="31.862">And</span> <span begin="31.862" end="32.396">heaven</span> <span begin="32.396" end="32.697">knows</span> <span begin="32.697" end="32.837">that</span> <span begin="32.837" end="33.040">it</span> <span begin="33.040" end="33.432">breaks</span> <span begin="33.432" end="33.669">my</span> <span begin="33.669" end="34.244">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">天知道 我心碎不已</span></p><p begin="34.711" end="40.008" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.711" end="36.464">Oh</spa